# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NexysVHDL — keep sources, configs, scripts, docs and small text logs;
# exclude toolchains, vendor installers and everything regenerated by a build.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Tool installations / downloaded toolchains (e.g. tools/ghdl-6.0.0/)
tools/ghdl-*/
tools/ghdl/
tools/**/bin/
tools/**/lib/
tools/_dl/

# Vendor installers and archives (e.g. Digilent Adept, downloaded manually)
**/downloads/
*.exe
*.msi
*.zip
*.tgz
*.tar.gz
*.whl

# FPGA build artifacts (Apio/openXC7)
**/_build/
*.bit
*.bin
*.frames
*.fasm
*.pnr
**/hardware.json
**/scons.params
**/sconsign.dblite

# GHDL output: generated Verilog is regenerated per platform
**/generated.v
**/generated.*.v
**/generated.run*.v.txt

# GHDL work libraries / simulation outputs
**/_sim/
**/work-obj*.cf
*.o
*.ghw
*.vcd
*.fst

# Saved copies of build outputs kept only for local comparison
**/_compare/
notes/**/build1/

# Vivado batch-mode scratch
.Xil/
*.jou
vivado*.log
vivado*.str
**/usage_statistics_webtalk.*

# Temporary files
**/tmp/
**/temp/
*.tmp
*.bak
*~

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/

# Node / future application build artifacts
node_modules/
dist/
out/
coverage/
*.vsix

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
